The command is primarily used for Domain Name System (DNS) diagnostics ,network troubleshooting, and domain management.
It allows system administrators, network engineers, and website owners to query DNS servers to retrieve specific domain records and IP addresses.
Also with the modified nslookup command we can know about any website DNS related things.
We can know about A/AAAA record,MX(Mail Exchange), NS(name server), CNAME and TX/SPF records ,those things are very useful thing of a web.
